---
// Experiment 2-10: how each of the six strategies turns a search result into what enters the context, and the outcome (redraw of Fig 2-17).
---

<svg
	class="dg"
	viewBox="0 0 720 628"
	role="img"
	aria-labelledby="d2-cf-title d2-cf-desc"
	style="min-width: 630px"
>
	<title id="d2-cf-title">Processing flow of six compression strategies</title>
	<desc id="d2-cf-desc">
		Each search returns about 52K characters on average, and each strategy handles them differently. Each row runs
		from the strategy to what it does to the result, to its outcome. 1, no compression: directly keep; the full
		original text goes into the context; 166K tokens, 102.1%, failed. 2, individual summary: independent summary;
		each result independently generates 2–3 paragraph summaries; 277K tokens, 10.9%, 12 rounds. 3, combined summary:
		merged summary; all results concatenated, then a unified summary; 93K tokens, 4.3%, 10 rounds. 4, context-aware,
		emphasized with a solid border and a highlighted, bold outcome: intelligent compression; given the query and
		context, targeted compression; 40K tokens, 3.0%, 7 rounds. 5, context-aware with citations: intelligent plus
		traceability; compressed content that retains URL citation markers; 223K tokens, 4.1%, 10 rounds. 6, adaptive
		window: deferred compression; below 80% of the window keep the original text, batch compress when exceeded; 175K
		tokens, 102.4%, 7 rounds.
	</desc>
	<defs>
		<marker id="d2-cf-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
			<path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="dg-arrowhead"></path>
		</marker>
	</defs>

	<text x="2" y="28" class="dg-title">Processing flow of six compression strategies</text>
	<text x="2" y="58" class="dg-sub">Each search returns ~52K characters on average → each strategy handles them differently</text>

	<!-- 1 -->
	<g class="dg-node dg-harness">
		<rect x="4" y="76" width="210" height="84" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="16" y="112" font-weight="700">① No compression</text>
		<text x="16" y="136" class="dg-sub">Directly keep</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="214" y1="118" x2="236" y2="118" marker-end="url(#d2-cf-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="240" y="76" width="226" height="84" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="252" y="112">Full original text</text>
		<text x="252" y="136">into context</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="466" y1="118" x2="488" y2="118" marker-end="url(#d2-cf-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="492" y="76" width="224" height="84" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="604" y="124" text-anchor="middle">166K tok · 102.1% · failed</text>
	</g>

	<!-- 2 -->
	<g class="dg-node dg-harness">
		<rect x="4" y="168" width="210" height="84" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="16" y="204" font-weight="700">② Individual summary</text>
		<text x="16" y="228" class="dg-sub">Independent summary</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="214" y1="210" x2="236" y2="210" marker-end="url(#d2-cf-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="240" y="168" width="226" height="84" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="252" y="192">Each result independently</text>
		<text x="252" y="216">generates 2–3 paragraph</text>
		<text x="252" y="240">summaries</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="466" y1="210" x2="488" y2="210" marker-end="url(#d2-cf-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="492" y="168" width="224" height="84" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="604" y="216" text-anchor="middle">277K tok · 10.9% · 12 rounds</text>
	</g>

	<!-- 3 -->
	<g class="dg-node dg-harness">
		<rect x="4" y="260" width="210" height="84" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="16" y="296" font-weight="700">③ Combined summary</text>
		<text x="16" y="320" class="dg-sub">Merged summary</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="214" y1="302" x2="236" y2="302" marker-end="url(#d2-cf-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="240" y="260" width="226" height="84" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="252" y="296">All results concatenated,</text>
		<text x="252" y="320">then unified summary</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="466" y1="302" x2="488" y2="302" marker-end="url(#d2-cf-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="492" y="260" width="224" height="84" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="604" y="308" text-anchor="middle">93K tok · 4.3% · 10 rounds</text>
	</g>

	<!-- 4 -->
	<g class="dg-node dg-harness dg-solid">
		<rect x="4" y="352" width="210" height="84" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="16" y="388" font-weight="700">④ Context-aware</text>
		<text x="16" y="412" class="dg-sub">Intelligent compression</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="214" y1="394" x2="236" y2="394" marker-end="url(#d2-cf-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="240" y="352" width="226" height="84" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="252" y="388">Given query + context →</text>
		<text x="252" y="412">targeted compression</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="466" y1="394" x2="488" y2="394" marker-end="url(#d2-cf-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-model">
		<rect x="492" y="352" width="224" height="84" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="604" y="400" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700">40K tok · 3.0% · 7 rounds</text>
	</g>

	<!-- 5 -->
	<g class="dg-node dg-harness">
		<rect x="4" y="444" width="210" height="84" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="16" y="468" font-weight="700">⑤ Context-aware</text>
		<text x="16" y="492" font-weight="700">+ citation</text>
		<text x="16" y="516" class="dg-sub">Intelligent + traceability</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="214" y1="486" x2="236" y2="486" marker-end="url(#d2-cf-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="240" y="444" width="226" height="84" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="252" y="468">Compressed content +</text>
		<text x="252" y="492">retain URL citation</text>
		<text x="252" y="516">markers</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="466" y1="486" x2="488" y2="486" marker-end="url(#d2-cf-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="492" y="444" width="224" height="84" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="604" y="492" text-anchor="middle">223K tok · 4.1% · 10 rounds</text>
	</g>

	<!-- 6 -->
	<g class="dg-node dg-harness">
		<rect x="4" y="536" width="210" height="84" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="16" y="572" font-weight="700">⑥ Adaptive window</text>
		<text x="16" y="596" class="dg-sub">Deferred compression</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="214" y1="578" x2="236" y2="578" marker-end="url(#d2-cf-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="240" y="536" width="226" height="84" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="252" y="560">&lt; 80% window: keep</text>
		<text x="252" y="584">original text; batch</text>
		<text x="252" y="608">compress when exceeded</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="466" y1="578" x2="488" y2="578" marker-end="url(#d2-cf-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="492" y="536" width="224" height="84" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="604" y="584" text-anchor="middle">175K tok · 102.4% · 7 rounds</text>
	</g>
</svg>
